<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1c1917; line-height: 1.6; background: #f5f5f4; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .card { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e7e5e4; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .header { border-bottom: 2px solid #15803d; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #0c0a09; margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
    .status-box { background: #dcfce7; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px; margin: 24px 0; text-align: center; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #b91c1c; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #f5f5f4; font-size: 12px; color: #a8a29e; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="title">Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware</h1>
      <p style="color: #78716c; font-size: 13px; margin: 0;">For Farms, Homes &amp; Lifestyles • Muchea, WA</p>
    </div>

    <p>G'day <%= @customer.first_name %>,</p>

    <div class="status-box">
      <strong style="color: #166534; font-size: 18px; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">
        🎉 Your Account Has Been Approved!
      </strong>
      <span style="font-size: 14px; color: #14532d;">
        Your member profile is now fully activated. Product prices, pallet discounts, and farm delivery ordering are unlocked.
      </span>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #44403c;">
      You can now log in to your account to view live inventory, stock feed prices, and place orders for drive-thru collection or scheduled farm delivery across Chittering, Bullsbrook, Gingin, and Bindoon.
    </p>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
      <a href="<%= customer_login_url %>" class="btn">
        Log In to View Live Prices &amp; Order →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      Muchea Trading Pty Ltd t/a Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware • 17b Edwards Pl, Muchea WA 6501<br>
      ABN 56 700 841 550 • ACN 700 841 550 • Phone: (08) 9571 8840
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
